notes.content:
We are delighted to announce our very own Steam event: the [b]Raid Survivors Festival[/b], where we celebrate a specific subgenre of roguelikes: the survivor-like! In these games, you survive an onslaught of thousands of enemies in various environments, level up your character in battle, put together unique builds from a variety of diverse abilities, and gradually turn your hero into a lean, mean killing machine.

Our very own [b]FatalZone[/b] falls squarely within this genre. It is a part of the Festival, and you can get it at a 10% discount all the way through this Steam event!

If you enjoy games of this genre, check out the [b][url=https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/101xp/sale/RaidSurvivors2024]Festival page[/url][/b] — there, you will find a host of such titles to suit every taste. Get good deals on great games and Wishlist upcoming projects! [b]— there, you will find a host of such titles to suit every taste. Get good deals on great games and Wishlist upcoming projects! [/b]

[url=https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/101xp/sale/RaidSurvivors2024][img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37268497/4734546e33d139b23aa4f37d86fdd67911fe703e.jpg[/img][/url]

While you’re here, we want to remind you about another important thing: [b]our project, FatalZone is now fully released![/b]

Over the course of Early Access we added a lot of exciting content. Right now, it includes:
[list][*] 5 locations;
[*] 9 playable classes;
[*] 57 unique perks for your Mercs;
[*] 9 weapon types;
[*] 9 armor types;
[*] 9 ultimate abilities;
[*] 43 offensive and defensive skills;
[*] 15 weapon and offensive skill evolutions;
[*] 41 enemy variations (with 21 unique designs);
[*] 6 difficulty levels for all locations;
[*] 7 base buildings, each with their own functionality and 10 upgrade levels;
[*] 51 Merc stats;
[*] Numerous mutations that randomize said stats;
[*] 5 boosters (not counting resources and experience);
[*] 330 achievements.[/list]
[previewyoutube=5_3KmbWAodE;full][/previewyoutube]

Moreover, we just dropped a massive release day update with a bunch of new additions: a new Mercenary class, a new location, new skills, new weapons, and a whole lot of achievements!

But wait, there’s more! There are also QoL improvements, including bug fixes and a partial UI redesign to accommodate full controller support. Now FatalZone plays better than ever! To learn more about the latest update, follow [b][url=https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2488510/view/4255420398681552532]this link.[/url][/b]

FatalZone is an auto-shooter with roguelike and RPG elements. Crush hordes of zombies in a world ravaged by a horrible virus epidemic, and collect resources for one of the last Survivor bases!

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2488510/

Please note that with the end of Early Access, the price of the game on the Steam Store will rise from 4.99 to 6.99 USD on September 25.
In honor of the themed Festival and release day update, FatalZone is offering an exclusive time-limited deal: 10% off the original price. If you’ve been meaning to get this game, this is your chance: a great opportunity to score a deal on the now-complete game! The promotion will end on September 24.

